content with different ids) is refused (400) instead of dropping a row and
still acknowledging it; id and verification lookups run in chunks of 50;
already_received counts every id-carrying row acknowledged without insert;
migration wrapped in a transaction with conrelid-scoped constraint lookups;
DB race check now asserts the loser hit the id unique constraint.

